      "content": "English: Massa | French: Massa | Latin: Massa | Origin: &#1502;&#1463;&#64298;&#1468;&#1464;&#1488; | Vietnamese: Ma-xa 1 -- con trai ông Ít-ma-ên, -- St 25,14 ; 1 Sb 1,30",
      "kind": "MARK_KIND_FOOTNOTE",
